(a) on satisfaction of the Bureau that the applican t has the necessary infrastructure and competence f or 
manufacturing and testing of refined precious metal as per the relevant Indian Standard; 
(b) if the refined precious metal conform to the relevant Indian standard; 
(c) on payment of marking fee as specified in Sched ule-V.

